    "text": "kswo.com\nwebsite\nElgin\nElgin educator named teacher of the year\nBy Haley WilsonKemar Noel,\n4 hours agoELGIN, Okla. (KSWO) - An Elgin teacher is the district’s first-ever Oklahoma Teacher of the Year. On June 27, Superintendent Nathaniel Meraz received notice that Elgin High School teacher Melissa Evon was selected. Melissa Evon became a teacher at Elgin in 1992. Her husband’s military career took her to...",
